      },
      "question": {
        ":question/id": "064e56a3-4271-5a76-93fa-eaa9c2a7b43d",
        ":question/problem": "Find $Hn$ if\n$H=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ -10 & -3\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$n=\\begin{bmatrix}8 \\\\ 7\\end{bmatrix}.$\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$Hn=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>",
        ":question/worked-solution": "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product. Multiplying the first row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Hn=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ -10 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}8 \\\\ 7\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}1\\cdot 8+2\\cdot 7 \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}22 \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the second row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Hn=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ -10 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}8 \\\\ 7\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}22 \\\\ (-10)\\cdot 8+(-3)\\cdot 7\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}22 \\\\ -101\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n$Hn=\\begin{bmatrix}22 \\\\ -101\\end{bmatrix}.$",
        ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
