  {
    "generator": "17592186100868-draft",
    "label": "17592186100868-draft:hard:q-275597:observed",
    "record": {
      "knowledge_point": {
        "db_id": 17592186100868,
        "id": "8451e22a-247e-51dd-8fb1-9ce9b212dc65",
        "title": "Multiplying a Matrix With Variable Entries by a Column Vector"
      },
      "question": {
        ":question/id": "8c399f03-2c5a-51ab-812f-ce6975401056",
        ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/hard",
        ":question/problem": "If \n$Q=\\begin{bmatrix}a & b & a \\\\ a & -b & a \\\\ 0 & 0 & a\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$r=\\begin{bmatrix}a \\\\ 0 \\\\ -a\\end{bmatrix},$\nfind $Qr.$\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$Qr=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>",
        ":question/worked-solution": "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Qr & =\\begin{bmatrix}a & b & a \\\\ a & -b & a \\\\ 0 & 0 & a\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}a \\\\ 0 \\\\ -a\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}a\\cdot a+b\\cdot 0+a\\cdot (-a) \\\\ a\\cdot a+(-b)\\cdot 0+a\\cdot (-a) \\\\ 0\\cdot a+0\\cdot 0+a\\cdot (-a)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}a^{2}+0-a^{2} \\\\ a^{2}+0-a^{2} \\\\ 0+0-a^{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -a^{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
        ":question/answer-fields": [
          {
