        ":question/problem": "Find $By$  if \n$B=\\begin{bmatrix}4p & -4q \\\\ -p & 3q\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$y=\\begin{bmatrix}p \\\\ q\\end{bmatrix}.$\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$By=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>",
        ":question/worked-solution": "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}By & =\\begin{bmatrix}4p & -4q \\\\ -p & 3q\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}p \\\\ q\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4p\\cdot p+(-4q)\\cdot q \\\\ (-p)\\cdot p+3q\\cdot q\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4p^{2}-4q^{2} \\\\ -p^{2}+3q^{2}\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
